{"PageNumber":24,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":154,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَا تَقُولُواْ لِمَن يُقۡتَلُ فِي سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ أَمۡوَٰتُۢۚ بَلۡ أَحۡيَآءٞ وَلَٰكِن لَّا تَشۡعُرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَا تَقُولُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> لِم<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>تَلُ فِى سَبِيلِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ أَمْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed><tajweed class=iqlab>تُۢ‌ۚ ب</tajweed>َلْ أَحْي<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ءٌ و</tajweed>َلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ك<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ل</tajweed>َّا تَشْعُر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٥٤</span>","End":"١٥٤","PageNumber":24,"JuzNumber":2,"ManzilNumber":1,"RukuNumber":20,"MaqraNumber":9,"HizbNumber":3,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":155,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَنَبۡلُوَنَّكُم بِشَيۡءٖ مِّنَ ٱلۡخَوۡفِ وَٱلۡجُوعِ وَنَقۡصٖ مِّنَ ٱلۡأَمۡوَٰلِ وَٱلۡأَنفُسِ وَٱلثَّمَرَٰتِۗ وَبَشِّرِ ٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","TajweedText":"وَلَنَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لُوَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َك<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِش<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َىْءٍ م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْخَوْفِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْجُوعِ وَنَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>صٍ م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَمْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نف</tajweed>ُسِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ثَّمَر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ‌ۗ وَبَشِّرِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بِر<tajweed class