dex":"002","VerseNumber":158,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞إِنَّ ٱلصَّفَا وَٱلۡمَرۡوَةَ مِن شَعَآئِرِ ٱللَّهِۖ فَمَنۡ حَجَّ ٱلۡبَيۡتَ أَوِ ٱعۡتَمَرَ فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيۡهِ أَن يَطَّوَّفَ بِهِمَاۚ وَمَن تَطَوَّعَ خَيۡرٗا فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ شَاكِرٌ عَلِيمٌ","TajweedText":"۞ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّفَا وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَرْوَةَ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ش</tajweed>َع<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِرِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ‌ۖ فَمَنْ حَجَّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَيْتَ أَوِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>عْتَمَرَ فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْهِ أ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َطَّوَّفَ بِهِمَا‌ۚ وَمَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َطَوَّعَ خَيْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>رًا ف</tajweed>َإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ شَاكِرٌ عَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>١٥٨</span>","End":"١٥٨","PageNumber":24,"JuzNumber":2,"ManzilNumber":1,"RukuNumber":20,"MaqraNumber":10,"HizbNumber":3,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":159,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَكۡتُمُونَ مَآ أَنزَلۡنَا مِنَ ٱلۡبَيِّنَٰتِ وَٱلۡهُدَىٰ مِنۢ بَعۡدِ مَا بَيَّنَّـٰهُ لِلنَّاسِ فِي ٱلۡكِتَٰبِ أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ يَلۡعَنُهُمُ ٱللَّهُ وَيَلۡعَنُهُمُ ٱللَّـٰعِنُونَ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ يَكْتُمُونَ م<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نز</tajweed>َلْنَا مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَيِّنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْهُدَىٰ م<tajweed class=iqlab>ِنۢ ب</tajweed>َعْدِ مَا بَيَّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ لِل<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed